WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.880
You've tried to learn Arabic before.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.370
A new script, tiny vowel marks, and words that slip away a week later.

3
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.380
You can recite it. But do you understand it?

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.170
Meet Rafiq, your companion in learning Arabic.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.740
Can't read the script yet? Start with the letters.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.770
Then one path, one Continue button, five to ten minutes a day.

7
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.320
Every word fully vowelled, and spoken by a native Arabic voice.

8
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.570
بَيْت — house

9
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:33.740
Rafiq remembers what you've learned, and brings each word back just before you'd forget it.

10
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.620
السَّلامُ عَلَيْكُمْ. أَنا جارُكَ الْجَدِيدُ. — Peace be upon you. I'm your new neighbour.

11
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:44.540
Then use it. Reply in your own words, and find out instantly if it makes sense.

12
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.630
It notices the mistakes you keep making, and helps you fix them.

13
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.400
A few minutes a day. Words that come back until they stay.

14
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:57.770
Try Rafiq free at rafiq-arabic.com.
